;; The Seventh's shaft (13-19) lands here. Two steps east (standing rows 6
;; and 4) climb to a low crawl (22-23, row 4) and the one-row passage at
;; column 24, which runs on through the Pipes' Against the Drip (its row 4,
;; columns 0-8) and ends at a lip four rows over that room's floor: one way.
;; West to Rain Rising (rows 6-8).
